flowchart LR
    user([Developer]) --> ui[React web app<br/>Vite · TypeScript · shadcn]
    ui --> api[.NET 10 API<br/>streaming session API]
    api -. status stream .-> ui
    api --> agent[Microsoft Agent Framework<br/>Harness + workflow]
    agent --> policy[Policy & approval<br/>human confirmation]
    policy --> tools[Workspace tools<br/>read · patch · search · test]
    agent --> router[Provider adapter<br/>capability-aware routing]
    router --> go[OpenCode Go]
    router --> deepseek[DeepSeek]
    router --> openrouter[OpenRouter]
    tools --> workspace[Disposable worktree<br/>or isolated container]
    api --> data[(SQLite<br/>sessions · audit · configuration)]
    agent --> telemetry[Telemetry<br/>quality · cost · reliability]
    tools --> telemetry
    telemetry -. optional export later .-> cloud[Azure hosting / monitoring]

